   "no": 2,
   "en": "INTERVENTION",
   "title": "AI 能做什么",
   "html": "<p>把矢量化拆成一条流水线：<strong>版面分析</strong>先切出图例区与图面区；图面区里<strong>符号检测</strong>（小目标用模板匹配就能做对，复杂符号上卷积网络）定位每一条钻孔、每一处矿点；<strong>注记 OCR</strong> 识别地层代号，再用图例词表校正——识别结果必须落在词表内，P 认成 F 这类错误大半能被拦下；<strong>线条追踪</strong>把断层线与界线转成矢量，断线处交给拓扑重建补全。</p><p>关键设计是<strong>图例—语义对照表</strong>：它把「像素颜色与符号形状」翻译成「地层含义」，跨年代、跨省的图例体系靠这张表统一。人从「描图员」变成「审图员」：只复核低置信度符号与拓扑断点，单幅复核约 10 分钟。</p><div class='figure'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 140' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='图件要素提取流水线'><g transform='translate(4,14)'><rect width='120' height='56' rx='8' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#1e63b4' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='60' y='25' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#1e63b4' text-anchor='middle'>扫描预处理</text><text x='60' y='44' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle'>纠偏 · 去斑 · 二值化</text></g><g transform='translate(152,14)'><rect width='120' height='56' rx='8' fill='#f6ebe1' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='60' y='25' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle'>版面分析</text><text x='60' y='44' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle'>图例区 / 图面区分割</text></g><g transform='translate(300,14)'><rect width='120' height='56' rx='8' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='60' y='25' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>符号检测</text><text x='60' y='44' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle'>模板匹配 · 目标检测</text></g><g transform='translate(448,14)'><rect width='120' height='56' rx='8' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#1e63b4' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='60' y='25' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#1e63b4' text-anchor='middle'>注记 OCR</text><text x='60' y='44' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle'>字符识别 + 词表校正</text></g><g transform='translate(596,14)'><rect width='120' height='56' rx='8' fill='#f7e9e6' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='60' y='25' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>矢量追踪入库</text><text x='60' y='44' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle'>线条追踪 · 拓扑重建</text></g><line x1='124' y1='42' x2='148' y2='42' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#g3a1)'/><line x1='272' y1='42' x2='296' y2='42' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#g3a1)'/><line x1='420' y1='42' x2='444' y2='42' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#g3a1)'/><line x1='568' y1='42' x2='592' y2='42' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#g3a1)'/><defs><marker id='g3a1' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#9ba3a9'/></marker></defs><text x='360' y='102' font-size='10' fill='#79828a' text-anchor='middle'>图例—语义对照表把「像素颜色与符号」翻译成「地层含义」——跨年代图例体系靠它统一</text><text x='360' y='120' font-size='10' fill='#79828a' text-anchor='middle'>人工只复核低置信度符号与拓扑断点：从 1—2 人日/幅 压到分钟级初稿 + 10 分钟复核</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>图 2</b><span>AI 介入点：<b>替代的是「看图—找符号—认字—描线」的全部手工环节</b>；图例对照表是整条流水线的语义枢纽。</span></div>"
